    "created_at": "2025-02-07T22:25:20Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-02-07T22:25:20Z",
    "body": "Coming back to this based on some recent work I've been doing with command invokers.\n\nWebKit and firefox both currently support popovertarget with reset buttons/inputs as per spec. Chrome is still \"wrong\" and doesn't support it.\n\nI'm updating webkits command invokers such that they also work on reset buttons and am correcting the tests.\n\nThat being said if we don't think either popovertarget nor command should work on reset buttons (with associated forms) I'm supportive of updating the spec and tests and impls to match. Though I think at least for popovertarget it should be a standalone very deliberate spec PR that does this.\n\nCc @keithamus ",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
