    "created_at": "2025-02-11T22:12:26Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-02-11T22:12:26Z",
    "body": "Cc @mfreed7 this seems relevant given discussion on Keith's editorial PR.\n\nEffectively the spec only bans popovertarget from working on form associated submit buttons. But chromium currently bans it from form associated reset buttons.\n\nWe need to decide which behaviour we prefer and update spec/tests/2 impls or update chromium.\n\nWith command/commandfor we also do get a do-over of sorts that we can change the behaviour for the new attributes and align with the spec for popovertarget.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
